SUMMARY:Activities Night - Register for a Table! -  - 12 Aug 19 00:00
DESCRIPTION:Are you a SSMU Club\, Service\, or Independent Student Group re
 ady to make your grand entrance into McGill student life? You are cordiall
 y invited to the most inclusive night of the year … Activities Night! It
 ’s the best place to showcase what your group has to offer and to attrac
 t the most dedicated and passionate of McGill!\n\nSign-Ups for registratio
 n can be found here. Registration is open today until September 2nd!\n\nTh
 is year\, Activities Night will be taking place on September 11th and 12th
  from 4 - 8 PM in Tomlinson Fieldhouse. To access the event in the Fieldho
 use\, you’ll need to enter through Tomlinson Hall. Click the map for mor
 e information!\n\nThe guide for tablers can be found here.\n\nLet’s make
  #AN2019 the best yet!\n\nThe SSMU acknowledges that McGill University is 
 situated on the traditional territory of the Haudenosaunee and Anishinaabe
  nations\, a place which has long served as a site of meeting and exchange
  amongst Indigenous peoples. The SSMU recognizes and respects these nation
 s as the traditional custodians of the land and water on which it is locat
 ed.
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ssmu.ca/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/table
 r_registration_SSMUcalendar.png
