SUMMARY:MoveCamp Fitness Event -  - 23 Aug 19 12:15
DESCRIPTION:MoveCamp is holding a special event to promote fitness in a pos
 itive way!\n\nMovecamp is on a mission to disrupt the fitness industry by 
 breaking down myths and messages that are doing more harm than good and ge
 tting people moving by making fitness simple and fun!\n\nParticipants shou
 ld wear comfortable clothes and running shoes and bring a water bottle and
  exercise mat.\n\nFind out more about MoveCamp at https://bit.ly/2JYQN87
