 tment/
SUMMARY:McGill Students for Think Pink Executive Recruitment -  - 3 Sep 19 
 00:00
DESCRIPTION:Are you interested in fighting breast cancer\, developing your 
 skills\, and meeting new friends? Then Think Pink is the club to join this
  year!   (•◡•) / We organize fun and informative events\, do food sa
 les\, and raise money for the Quebec Breast Cancer Foundation. We aim to g
 ive all members opportunities to plan aspects of our events and to have fu
 n together. If you're motivated and interested in the cause\, we invite yo
 u to apply for one of our open VP or committee positions by September 18th
 . See our Facebook event for all links and information! 
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ssmu.ca/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/exec-
 recruitment-banner-2.jpg
CATEGORIES:Charity
END:VEVENT
