URL:https://ssmu.ca/events/hema-quebec-and-mss-blood-drive-la-collecte-hem
 a-quebec-et-mss/
SUMMARY:Héma-Québec and MSS Blood drive/ La collecte Héma-Québec et MSS
  -  - 9 Sep 19 09:00
DESCRIPTION:Have you ever donated blood before? Well this is your chance to
  literally participate in SAVING A LIFE! Come join the annual Medical Stud
 ent’s Society blood donor clinic! This year we are doing something a lit
 tle different – we are bringing in the Héma Québec mobile blood collec
 tion unit and parking it at two different locations on McGill campus over 
 the span of 4 days. Check the event page for more details.
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ssmu.ca/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/MSS-B
 lood-Drive-1.jpg
CATEGORIES:Community,Faculty Events,Featured Event
END:VEVENT
