URL:https://ssmu.ca/events/kickoff-party-2019/
SUMMARY:Kickoff Party 2019 -  - 13 Sep 19 00:00
DESCRIPTION:Hi MISA friends\, welcome back! Let’s celebrate the new acade
 mic year together with a kickoff party! The event starts at 9:00pm sharp. 
 The first hour will be an opportunity to socialize and find new friends. I
 t may be the best time for the new students to network with and get to kno
 w upper year students. Also during this time\, MISA’s executive council 
 will speak shortly about MISA\, our events and our plans for this year. \n
 \nAt 10pm\, the party will officially start and we will have a memorable n
 ight with the beautiful performance of Djplus. Thompson house restaurant w
 ill be open until 9:30 pm\, for anyone who would like to order something t
 o eat. Bar services will be available for the duration of the night. The d
 ress code is semi-formal.\n\nWe hope you will accompany us in celebrating 
 the new academic year with energy and enthusiasm!\nThis party is not exclu
 sive to MISA members/Iranian students\, please do not hesitate to bring al
 ong your friends as well!\nTo register\, please click on the following lin
 k https://mcgilliranianstudentassociation.eventsmart.com/events/kickoff-pa
 rty-2019/
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ssmu.ca/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/IMG_9
 261.jpg
CATEGORIES:Parties &amp; Drinking
LOCATION:\, 3650 McTavish St.\, Montreal \, Quebec \, H3A 1Y2\, Canada
